%% Title: MediSearch Deployment Flow
flowchart LR
  Code[Code Changes] --> Commit[Git Commit]
  Commit --> Push[Push to GitHub]
  Push --> CI[GitHub / Vercel Build Trigger]
  CI --> Install[Install Dependencies]
  Install --> Build[Build Angular or Package Node API]
  Build --> Env[Inject Environment Variables and Secrets]
  Env --> Deploy[Deploy to Vercel]
  Deploy --> Smoke[Run Health and Connectivity Checks]
  Smoke --> Live[Production Frontend and Backend URLs]
  Live --> Monitor[Monitor Logs and Metrics]
